OL,3,GNEWSADo West county borders make it
OL,4,Ahard to 'belong'?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe county borders of the West of
OL,7,FEngland are clear on the map. But how
OL,8,Fmuch do they mean when areas rub up
OL,9,Fagainst each other?
OL,11,FFor example, if you live in Kingswood,
OL,12,Fyou pay council tax to South
OL,13,FGloucestershire Council, but may well
OL,14,Fdescribe yourself as a Bristolian. Do
OL,15,Fpeople in Keynsham say they live "near
OL,16,FBath" or "near Bristol"? And do people
OL,17,Fborn and raised in Taunton or Shepton
OL,18,FMallet consider the Chew Valley or
OL,19,FClevedon "proper" Somerset?
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,348,340,200,160,0,100
