OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F347A1788242208
OL,1,W5j 5Q555pjsjjj js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSADo West county borders make it
OL,4,Ahard to 'belong'?
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlenty of places in the West have found
OL,7,Fthemselves in different counties as
OL,8,Fborders have moved. And many people
OL,9,Fshudder if you mention the word Avon,
OL,10,Fthe now-defunct authority that used to
OL,11,Fcover Bristol, Bath and parts of
OL,12,FSomerset and Gloucestershire.
OL,14,FSo how did the county borders we have
OL,15,Ftoday come about, and how does identity
OL,16,Fwork if you live close to the borders?
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
